{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"role":"collection","title":"Destinations","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"Destinations","symbolKind":"module"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plain sink with one requirement, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which is given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a batch of records, oldest first. Delivering is a chain of operators over a tracker’s records:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch()"},{"type":"text","text":" gathers them into batches of 20, and every 30 seconds while any are pending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deliver(to:batchBufferLimit:)"},{"type":"text","text":" makes a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"},{"type":"text","text":", which hands each batch to every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination. It holds a lazy unit of work, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work"},{"type":"text","text":", that runs once you call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"execute()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each destination receives its batches in order, one at a time, from a buffer of its own, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slow one delays only itself. A full buffer drops its oldest batch and reports it as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport"},{"type":"text","text":" on the delivery’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports"},{"type":"text","text":", which one task reads at a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time, as every report stream does. When the tracker has a store, the delivery reads the dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch’s records back for that destination once it catches up, and tells the store when each batch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has reached every destination."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What a destination receives is narrowed by modifiers: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/accepting(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent categories it serves, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/redactingSensitiveValues()"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/droppingCallSite()"},{"type":"text","text":", and added to by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which runs an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"type":"text","text":" on the records that destination alone receives. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints each event, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the newest records it receives for the app to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read, in a debug view or a test."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Logs, traces and servers have destinations in modules of their own, so an app links only the ones","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it uses: ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggerDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"SpanEventDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"TracingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Uploader: Destination {","    func receive(_ batch: [EventRecord]) async {","        \/\/ Send the batch, and return once it is somewhere it won't be lost.","    }","}","","let inspector = try InMemoryDestination(capacity: 500)","let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records","    .batch(strategy: .count(20))","    .deliver(","        to: Uploader().accepting(.analytics).redactingSensitiveValues().droppingCallSite(),","        inspector","    )","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","let received = inspector.events(of: SignedUp.self)  \/\/ [SignedUp(plan: \"pro\")]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"typ